{"sections":[{"slug":"概形","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"概形"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"概形"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">概形是代数几何中的一种几何对象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其</span> Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">局部上同构于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/仿射概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">传统</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">概形是局部同构于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/仿射概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部环化空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部环化空间</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">函子式</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">概形是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/仿射概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Aff}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Zariski景","text":"Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">拓扑</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的层</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且具有仿射开覆盖</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">不是仿射概形的例子</span></h3>\n<p>$\\mathbb A^2_k\\setminus\\{(0,0)\\}$ <span lang=\"zh\">不是仿射概形</span>.</p>\n<p>$\\mathbb P^1_k$ <span lang=\"zh\">不是仿射概形</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导出概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}